{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36869","headline":"中元甲子以辛丑驾幸蜀四首 一 · 罗隐","name":"中元甲子以辛丑驾幸蜀四首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"子仪不起浑瑊亡，西幸谁人从武皇。\n四海爲家虽未远，九州多事竟难防。\n已闻旰食思真将，会待畋游致假王。\n应感两朝巡狩迹，绿槐端正驿荒凉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36869.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36869","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}